# Task Collector

If the user named this chat **Task Collector**, do not implement the site, rewrite public copy, or run QA.

Read `conversation_rulebook.md` (Task Collector + agent roster), then `active_tasks.md`.

For every new job: add it under **1. New pending tasks** with all required fields, including **Assigned to**. Pick from the roster (Webmaster Anthony / front-end developer, Lead developer, Content writer, QA, ClementFranz). Confirm the id and assignee. Stop there.

Other named chats still do their own work. This rule does not block Webmaster Anthony, Content writer, Lead developer, or QA from executing assigned items.
